Description: Kompas software store for Zorin and Ubuntu
 A fork of COSMIC Store with Flatpak and PackageKit integration,
 download-based discovery and estimated Wayland compatibility badges.
 Targets Zorin and Ubuntu desktops without Pop!_OS-specific data packages.
